    {
        "content": "<p>Hi <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1084095\">@Anand Nambakam</span>. This sounds like a great PR, and 88 lines seems the right size! Easiest thing to do is make a PR, and then we can look at it and discuss it together. </p>\n<p>I think <code>QuantumInfo/Finite/GeometricPhase/</code> is a good location for now. I've been thinking about the overall structure of the <code>QuantumInfo</code> file here <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/479953-Physlib/topic/QuantumInfo.20file.20system/near/596907523\">#Physlib &gt; QuantumInfo file system @ 💬</a> , but if that change is made it will likely be after your PR.</p>",
        "id": 597272334,
        "sender_full_name": "Joseph Tooby-Smith",
        "timestamp": 1779513412
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thank you <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"653351\">@Joseph Tooby-Smith</span> , here's a <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/physlib/pull/1121\">link to the PR</a></p>",
